# Saxitoxin DNA Binding

## Sequences
Original M30-f (Apt)
TTGAGGGTCGCATCCCGTGGAAACAGGTTCATTG
Terminal hairpin-modified M30-f (TH-Apt)
GGCGGGTTTTGAGGGTCGCATCCCGTGGAAACAGGTTCATTGTTCCCGCC
4 bases mismatched-modified M30-f (4 MM-TH-Apt)
GGCGGGTTTTGATTTTCGCATCCCGTGGAAACAGGTTTATTGTTCCCGCC
Scrambled-modified M30-f (Scr-TH-Apt)
TTCTCGCAGCCAGATCTGGCCAGGTTGTTACAGCGGAGGTGCTTGGCGTC

## Binding Motifs:
TCGCATCCCGTGGAA (for original, terminal, 4 base mismatched)
CTGGCCAGGTTGTTA (for scrambled)

## Ligand of Interest:
Saxitoxin: https://www.rcsb.org/ligand/9SL

## Conditions:
Buffer: 10 mM Tris, 140 mM NaCl, 2.7 mM KCl, 8.1 mM Na₂HPO₄, and 1.76 mM KH₂PO₄ (pH 7.4).
Temperature: 25 degrees.